						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;margin-top:8pt;">We have agreed to issue and sell the common shares offered hereby to the purchasers through Roth Capital Partners, LLC (the &#x201c;placement agent&#x201d;). The placement agent is not required to buy or sell any specific number or dollar amount of the common shares offered hereby, but it will use its reasonable best efforts to solicit offers to purchase the common shares offered by this prospectus. See &#x201c;Plan of Distribution&#x201d; on page S<FONT CLASS="nobreak">-17</FONT>.</P>
